{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/ocm01715143","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"ocm01715143 ","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"BH301.S75 V2","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"VVV: poetry, plastic arts, anthropology, sociology, psychology.","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"publisher not identified","id":"actor/publisher-not-identified","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1942-1944","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"SColl abq : Inscription on p. 68 from Marcel Duchamp to [Alfred] Stieglitz, March 32, 1943 : \"Since we met / until we meet again / dear Stieglitz / Marcel Duchamp / 32nd March 1943\".|abq copy : fair condition.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Editor: David Hare; editorial advisers: André Breton, Marcel Duchamp (no. 2/3-4 only), Max Ernst.\nCover of no. 1 by Max Ernst; cover of no. 2/3 by Marcel Duchamp; cover of no. 4 by Matta.\nPart of the illustrative material is colored, part mounted.  No. 2/3 (March 1943) includes a piece of chickenwire mounted in the back cover.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nEphemera : originally housed in manila file folder with annotation by Georgia O'Keeffe :  \"Almanac 43 - Poetry 22 Little Review 26 Felix Weingartner / On Conducting\".","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}